    "project": "research/residue_weighted_length_audit_20261115/lean",
    "theorem": "ResidueWeightedLengthAudit.residue_weighted_length_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem residue_weighted_length_certificate : (∀ (K A : Type) [Field K] [CommRing A] [Algebra K A] [Module.Finite K A], Module.finrank K A = weightedDegree K A) ∧ (∀ (K A : Type) [Field K] [CommRing A] [Algebra K A] [Module.Finite K A], Module.finrank K A = schemeWeightedDegree K A) ∧ (∀ (R : Type) [CommRing R] (p : PrimeSpectrum R), Nonempty (p.asIdeal.ResidueField ≃+* IsLocalRing.ResidueField (ActualAffineStalk R p))) ∧ (∀ (K R : Type) [Field K] [CommRing R] [Algebra K R] (p : PrimeSpectrum R), Nonempty (p.asIdeal.ResidueField ≃ₐ[K] IsLocalRing.ResidueField (ActualAffineStalk R p))) ∧ (∀ (K B M : Type) [Field K] [CommRing B] [IsLocalRing B] [Algebra K B] [Module.Finite K B] [AddCommGroup M] [Module K M] [Module B M] [IsScalarTower K B M], Module.length K M = Module.length B M * Module.finrank K (IsLocalRing.ResidueField B)) ∧ (∀ (K A : Type) [Field K] [CommRing A] [Algebra K A] [Module.Finite K A] [IsReduced A], unweightedDegree K A = Nat.card (PrimeSpectrum A)) ∧ Module.finrank Base ProductAlgebra = 3 ∧ Module.length ProductAlgebra ProductAlgebra = 2 ∧ Nat.card (PrimeSpectrum ProductAlgebra) = 2 ∧ (∀ p : PrimeSpectrum ProductAlgebra, p = firstPoint ∨ p = secondPoint) ∧ firstPoint ≠ secondPoint ∧ (∀ p : PrimeSpectrum ProductAlgebra, Module.length (Localization.AtPrime p.asIdeal) (Localization.AtPrime p.asIdeal) = 1) ∧ Nonempty (firstIdeal.ResidueField ≃ₐ[Base] Base) ∧ Nonempty (secondIdeal.ResidueField ≃ₐ[Base] Quad) ∧ Module.finrank Base firstIdeal.ResidueField = 1 ∧ Module.finrank Base secondIdeal.ResidueField = 2 ∧ weightedDegree Base ProductAlgebra = 3 ∧ unweightedDegree Base ProductAlgebra = 2 ∧ weightedDegree Base ProductAlgebra ≠ unweightedDegree Base ProductAlgebra ∧ ¬ IsLocalRing ProductAlgebra ∧ weightedDegree Base (Base × Base) = 2 ∧ unweightedDegree Base (Base × Base) = 2 ∧ weightedDegree JVHilbertAudit.F JVHilbertAudit.A = 8 ∧ Module.finrank JVHilbertAudit.F JVLocalMultiplicityAudit.originIdeal.ResidueField = 1 ∧ weightedDegree JVHilbertAudit.F JVLocalMultiplicityAudit.FirstChart = 0",
    "decl_sha256": "dbc58003cb9d2d0b43292135c7e00c0fc26ee1965d82d6d8b9606b0e1c3c8732",
    "scope": "Every fieldK and finite-dimensional commutative K-algebraA: scalar dimension equals the actual finite prime sum of canonical prime-localization self-module lengths times actual prime residue-field K-degrees. Also equals the actual affine-Spec structure-sheaf stalk self-length sum weighted by actual stalk canonical residue-field K-degrees. Actual canonical prime/stalk residue comparison is K-linear; actual K→A→stalk coefficient algebra/tower and actual stalk locality derived, not supplied. Artinian/finite-prime/finite-localization data derived from finite scalar dimension. Generic compatible localB-moduleM has scalar length=Blength times canonical residue degree; usual field/locality/finiteB/module/tower hypotheses retained. Reduced finite algebra unweighted local length equals primecard; zero algebra guard retained. Actual F2×GaloisField(2,2) scalar dimension3/selflength2/exactly2prime closed points, actual complete projection-kernel classification/distinctness/localselflength1,1/residue algebraequivalences toF2,F4/degrees1,2/weighted3/unweighted2/nonlocality. Dropping residue weights fails; no base-rational/geometric point population claimed. Split actual F2×F2 weighted/unweighted2. Known actual literal JV F101 quotient weighted8 and derived canonical origin residue degree1; credited actual zero first chart weighted0. Existing F4/F2 local-degree control/JV populations/official decomposition-composition-series-stalk methods credited, no novelty. Seven new modules(6concrete1import-only),28frozen local modules/0copies/49oldformalconfigs/67oldformal-artifactpins checked before/after every numberedstate and gate. Qualified Diem n!d^n with multiplicities unrefuted; ordinary cone not product-projective instance. General Chow/cycle/intersection/positive-dimensional isolated components/projective bound/RojasC refinement and other14 obligations remainopen. Samehost/prover/no new solver or cryptographic experiment/compilerrefinement/physicalhost independence/canonicalpromotion/full14 claim. Defaultlimits/foundations only/noholes/customaxioms/nativeproofeval/raisedlimits/globalflags/waivers/frozenedits/cryptoPython/spend/upload.",
